{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-02_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-02","title":"善意背叛","storyCode":"12-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ead7effec7943d3a81e162ab914d30857b4a83ad8ab10d45a0a92c42963c98f5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"自救军内部因为行动方针展开了争论，推进之王坚持回到诺伯特区支援格拉斯哥帮的同伴。与此同时，自救军的所有基地遭到袭击，情况紧急。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g6_hideout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，博士，你们来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，如你们所见，我们的士气......很低迷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里乱糟糟的，请别介意。自从阿勒黛......离开后，我们的后勤补给一直是个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，在眼下的麻烦面前，这算是最好解决的一个了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在上一场战斗中，我们的减员很严重。我们曾经以为这些牺牲不会白费，只要阻止萨卡兹推进那些工程，一切就还有挽回余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾，他们的行动比我们预计的快得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹们......他们不仅有碎片大厦，他们还制造了那艘“飞空艇”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简报已经分发到了大家手上，飞空艇不加掩饰地袭击了温德米尔公爵的军队，和平的假象已不复存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而碎片大厦......萨卡兹既然主动挑起了这场战争，那么，他们对于碎片大厦的掌控......很可能比我们预想的进度还要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不敢赌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......阿勒黛和我提起过这把剑的传说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说可以劈开天灾的诸王之息是维多利亚最牢固的盾，足以抵挡被牵引而来的风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她也一定告诉过你，正因为能激发这种力量的人实在罕有，才有了王宫地下“剑座”的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推进之王，你真的没从这把剑里感受到什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是......我不知道，一种召唤？或者微微发热的感觉？或者是突然能够运用什么厉害的源石技艺之类的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定，你确实可以......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，什么都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把剑很冷，很硬，挥动起来比锤子要轻一点，不太好掌控力道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有别的吗？哪怕只是一点点别扭的地方——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它在上战场前应该好好地打磨一下，已经有点钝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我们暂时没办法指望这把剑能够直接派上用场，为我们免除碎片大厦的威胁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但它也不会再成为大公爵们互相倾轧的筹码。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"萨卡兹们在启用碎片大厦前也许会多一些顾虑。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，罗德岛的博士，这把剑掌握在我们手中总比在其他势力手中要好，我们最起码可以避免它沦为这场战争的帮凶，这已经足够重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......足够重要，是吗，这已经足够重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）阿勒黛，如果我能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用灰心，推进之王小姐，也许你只是还没掌握方法，或者是还不到时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那条补给线我已经分析得差不多了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起点基本上可以确定是在伦蒂尼姆郊外的布伦特伍德，而终点有很多个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了海布里区的军工厂之外，很有可能有一条路线直接延伸到碎片大厦地下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我们发现得太晚了，如果早一个月——不，哪怕早十天，事情可能都不会发展到如今的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这条补给线的情报仍然有意义，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这是一条足够承担重型物资运输的线路，并且能够直通碎片大厦地底——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那么，运别的也行。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这是个反攻的机会。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争爆发后，特雷西斯的身边很可能没有太多戍卫，各王庭之主需要指挥自己的部属对抗各大公爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫妖的入局可能会是个问题......但据我对他们的了解，他们从不会真正选择支持谁，更何况，凯尔希女士应该已经与他们的信使谈过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿他们听进去了凯尔希女士的忠告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我们最好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你倒是提一句诺伯特区的事呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被那帮萨卡兹混蛋抛出去的可是我们的街区！贝尔德还在那里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，比起什么补给线大反攻，我们得去帮她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请冷静一些，我们需要考虑整体局势......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，骑士阁下想教训我以大局为重？我可管不了怎么干掉一个萨卡兹的老妖怪，现在老子的朋友有危险，老子的家有危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想让我们袖手旁观？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"达格达","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我知道你很焦躁，可是我们必须考虑到任何可能的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我同样不建议你们独自行动，在我们确定那位想抢夺国剑的人彻底放弃计划之前，你们最好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最好躲在地下的夹层里当懦夫？得了吧！我们能应付那些鬼鬼祟祟的家伙们！现在，最重要的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"够了，因陀罗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"针对特雷西斯的行动会在什么时候开始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会太快，我们需要侦察那些补给线的具体情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"碎片大厦内部的结构也需要调查。特雷西斯......很强大，任何一点松懈都会要了我们的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"具体时间呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"半个月内，我希望能在碎片大厦被他真正启动前......了结这些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，我申请在这次行动之前暂时离队。请放心，我会在任务开始时回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你还是坚持要前往诺伯特区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经失去很多朋友了，克洛维希娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有办法一次又一次地袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这确实是个出于我个人情感的要求，我不会避讳这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但与此同时，我也认为这是个机会，在我们的正式行动开始之前，解决掉一些潜藏的隐患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......比如，那些伤害阿勒黛的人，那些想要诸王之息的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那无疑是一位大公爵，无论他接下来打算摆出什么立场，我想......我都该和他好好“谈一谈”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿斯卡纶小姐说了，我们的时间并不充裕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会处理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，你怎么看？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"在那个地块上，还有件值得注意的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，萨卡兹的飞空艇很可能停靠在现在的诺伯特区中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也意味着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......特蕾西娅小姐，也许也在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这场战争中，我们一定会面对她，或迟或早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一件事，Logos先生和我提到过——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"紧急......讯......紧急......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹突袭......卡登区的安全屋......我们......他们的部队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡登区？怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":true,"text":"奥克特里格区的安全屋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自救军战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_398_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......袭击，警报......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":true,"text":"费斯特！海布里区的安全屋正在遭受袭击！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们那边情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我们正在组织还击，向地下深层撤退，情况很危急，萨卡兹很可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......这绝不是一次简单的清剿，他们准备......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......必须......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶？听得到吗？奶奶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，通讯断了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是怎么回事？现在已经有三座安全屋正在遭到萨卡兹的袭击了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里的通讯断了，我们需要支援他们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不只是三座安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我们这里的通讯被切断了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avg_npc_407_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，趴下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛维希娅，这是怎么了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，这里也被......这里可是自救军保密等级最高的区域！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......Logos先生和我提到过，萨卡兹可能正在渗透我们的情报网络。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鉴于现在的情况，我只能判断，保密失效的等级比我们原来预计的高得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有可能，所有的自救军基地都遭到了袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们必须撤离！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可是，去哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，萨卡兹的攻势很猛烈，他们早就盯上这里了，外层通道已经失守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"......现在，中层的缓冲区也被突破了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，敌人使用了新式的萨卡兹巫术装置。那种数量，还有威力......我们的城防军和自救军朋友难以应对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坦白地说，我们没有胜算，组织防守的罗本撑不了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撑不了多久......是多久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五分钟......不，半个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的时间最多只有这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤离，该死，我们该向哪里撤离？自救军现在在伦蒂尼姆没有一处安全的去处！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仪器厂的第三仓库？四季百货的停车场？伯恩子爵的公寓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不行，风险都太高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定还有什么地方......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果伦蒂尼姆城内危机四伏，我们也许可以暂时撤出。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"撤出伦蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！萨卡兹的那条补给线！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们可以反向利用海布里区的补给线，撤出伦蒂尼姆城！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有太多伤员和非战斗人员了，走地下能够帮助我们避免大部分战斗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我们在伦蒂尼姆的这些成果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的攻势只能说明，之前他们只是觉得没有必要摧毁我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在战争爆发的现在，军事委员会开始真正把自救军视作威胁了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有犹豫的时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"号角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要立刻去支援罗本。我们会尽可能地吸引萨卡兹的主力部队，掩护你们撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，博士，自救军在这场撤离中需要你们的援助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"义不容辞，我们不会抛弃任何盟友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿斯卡纶，组织突围。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"}]},{"label":"Misery，销毁档案。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Misery","speakerId":"avg_npc_235","isRemote":false,"text":"已经在做了。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"Logos。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"帮助号角小姐和她的队伍拖延时间。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会保证你们的安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"转移与再加密的计划还未来得及落实，王庭选了个最完美的时机发动清剿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看来，他们比我们想象的更了解我们。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯也比他之前佯装出来的......更敏锐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这里已经注定失守，我想......闹得大一些也无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生，我们还是会回来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们可以重建这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛维希娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，只要找到海布里区的补给线入口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"费斯特，交给你了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我了解了，各位，跟我来。"}]},{"label":"洛洛，你很熟悉地下的那些管线通道。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛洛","speakerId":"avg_4040_rockr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我会带着伤员们安全撤离的。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可露希尔，带着伤员和非战斗人员跟他们走。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希......就交给你和闪灵了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，Dr.{@nickname}，开什么玩笑！我要是非战斗人员，那你也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我绝对够把你打趴下！是你该跟着他们撤离！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅和阿斯卡纶能保证我的安全。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......我绝不会让您受伤。"}]},{"label":"我们来牵制萨卡兹追兵，这样最保险。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，真狡猾。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，三支队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"号角、Misery、Logos他们作为对抗萨卡兹围剿的主力行动。博士您和阿米娅与推进之王他们牵制萨卡兹的其他追兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和闪灵跟着自救军的其他人，安静地完成撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们最终在哪里会合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个伦蒂尼姆郊外的镇子......布伦特伍德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_411_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行动确认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_394_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争已经爆发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","spea